, "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2378218, "sourcename": "", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://mzt.fujian.gov.cn/zfxxgkzl/zfxxgkml/gfxwj/ylfw/202510/t20251027_7026023.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2124812, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/rsj/zfxxgkml/ldgx/202505/t20250522_2124812.htm", "content": "各县（市、区）人力资源和社会保障局（民政和人力资源社会保障局）、发改局、商务局、民政局、教育局、农业农村局、妇联、总工会：\n　　为贯彻落实《福建省促进“一老一小”家政服务发展若干措施》（闽政办〔2024〕2", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/rsj/zfxxgkml/ldgx/202505/t20250522_2124812.htm", "docreltime": "2025.05.22 14:58:00", "doctitle": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局等八部门关于印发促进家政服务发展九条措施的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "明人社〔2025〕111号", "idxid": "SM00113-40-2025-00047", "itvid": "", "modal": 2, "pubdate": "2025.05.13 00:00:00", "puborg": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "recid": 2362720, "sourcename": "三明市人力资源和社会保障局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/rsj/zfxxgkml/ldgx/202505/t20250522_2124812.htm", "ztcx": "有效", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://rsj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/rsj/zfxxgkml/ldgx/202505/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2124361, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/mzj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2292/202503/t20250325_2109546.htm", "content": "", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/mzj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2292/202503/t20250325_2109546.htm", "docreltime": "2025.03.25 09:34:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局等六部门关于印发三明市家装厨卫“焕新”居家适老化改造补贴实施细则的通知", "doctype": 30, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2320791, "sourcename": "三明日报", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 30, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/szfgzjg/mzj/zfxxgkml/gfxwj_2292/202503/t20250325_2109546.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2089464, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202412/t20241226_2089464.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）民政（民政和人力资源社会保障）局、发改局、商务局、财政局、住建局：\n　　为切实做好三明市消费品以旧换新居家适老化改造政策落实工作，特制定《三明市消费品以旧换新居家适老化改造实施细则》", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202412/t20241226_2089464.htm", "docreltime": "2024.11.19 14:57:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局 三明市发展和改革委员会 三明市商务局 三明市财政局 三明市住房和城乡建设局关于印发三明市消费品以旧换新 居家适老化改造实施细则的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2280142, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202412/t20241226_2089464.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202412/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2061485, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202409/t20240918_2061485.htm", "content": "\n　　近年来，检察机关办案中发现，侵犯养老机构被看护人人身权利犯罪案件时有发生，有的后果特别严重，社会影响特别恶劣，反映出养老机构安全保障制度未得到严格落实、养老机构工作人员的招录管理工作存在漏洞等问题", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/ylfw/202409/t20240918_2061485.htm", "docreltime": "2024.09.18 16:45:00", "doctitle": "什么是“第十一号检察建议”？", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 3, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2245544, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/ylfw/202409/t20240918_2061485.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://mzj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/ylfw/202409/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2043116, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202407/t20240715_2043116.htm", "content": "\n　　各县（市、区）民政局：\n　　现将《深化“整治公建民营等养老机构服务不规范问题 推动养老服务质量提升”工作方案》印发给你们，请认真组织实施，有关工作进展情况和问题线索及时报送市民政局（联系人：陈舒婷，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202407/t20240715_2043116.htm", "docreltime": "2024.07.15 15:42:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局关于印发《深化“整治公建民营等养老机构服务不规范问题 推动养老服务质量提升”工作方案》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2220646, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202407/t20240715_2043116.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202407/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 2007808, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202403/t20240308_2007808.htm", "content": "\n　　各市、县（区）、平潭综合实验区有关单位：\n　　为加快推进我省老年助餐服务体系建设，省民政厅等13部门联合出台《关于加快发展老年助餐服务的若干措施》，现印发给你们，请结合实际，认真组织实施。\n　　福建省", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202403/t20240308_2007808.htm", "docreltime": "2024.01.15 10:49:00", "doctitle": "福建省民政厅等13部门印发《关于加快发展老年助餐服务的若干措施》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2179621, "sourcename": "三明市民政局网站", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202403/t20240308_2007808.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202403/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1948806, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202309/t20230920_1948806.htm", "content": "\n　　明民规〔2023〕2号\n　　各县（市、区）民政局、教育局、财政局人力资源和社会保障局：\n　　为鼓励和吸引更多优秀人才从事养老护理工作，根据《福建省养老服务条例》《三明市人民政府办公室关于印发推动老龄事业", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202309/t20230920_1948806.htm", "docreltime": "2023.09.20 17:46:00", "doctitle": "三明市民政局 三明市教育局 三明市财政局 三明市人力资源和社会保障局关于印发《三明市养老护理人员入职和在职补贴实施办法》的通知", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2109641, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202309/t20230920_1948806.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202309/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1923054, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/t20230711_1923054.htm", "content": "\n　　为贯彻落实《“十四五”国家老龄事业发展和养老服务体系规划》有关要求，指导各地民政部门更好落实《民政部关于加快建立全国统一养老机构等级评定体系的指导意见》，实施好《养老机构等级划分与评定》国家标准，", "docabstract": "", "doclogo": "", "docpeople": "", "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/t20230711_1923054.htm", "docreltime": "2023.07.11 17:35:00", "doctitle": "《养老机构等级划分与评定》国家标准实施指南（2023版）对外发布", "doctype": 20, "efftype": "", "fileno": "", "idxid": "", "itvid": "", "modal": 1, "pubdate": "", "puborg": "", "recid": 2076722, "sourcename": "三明市民政局", "subdoctitle": "", "type": 20, "url": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/t20230711_1923054.htm", "ztcx": "", "tpfl": "", "pics": [], "files": [{"appdesc": "《养老机构等级划分与评定》国家标准实施指南（2023版）.docx", "appdocid": 1923054, "appfile": "P020230711634110749627.docx", "appflag": 10, "appsern": 1, "docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/t20230711_1923054.htm", "fileext": "docx", "_src": "/protect/P0202307/P020230711/P020230711634110749627.docx", "_href": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/P020230711634110749627.docx"}], "_docpuburl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zcwjjjd/202307/", "rels": []}, {"docid2": 1916218, "bgxz": "", "chnl": "政策文件及解读", "chnldocurl": "http://www.sm.gov.cn/zw/zfxxgkzdgz/ylfw/zc